{"lessonId":18,"version":"7f76b182a0d6","questions":[{"kind":"word-form-choice","sourceId":"v1:part5:18:10","wordId":"accurately-18","prompt":"To assure that your order is ________ filled, it will be checked by a two-person team.","answer":"accurately","options":["accurately","accurateness","accurate","accuracy"],"sourceVersion":"7f76b182a0d6"},{"kind":"word-form-choice","sourceId":"v1:part5:18:11","wordId":"fulfill-18","prompt":"The suppliers have ________ the terms of our agreement and are now our supplier of choice.","answer":"fulfilled","options":["fulfilling","fulfillment","fulfilled","fulfill"],"sourceVersion":"7f76b182a0d6"},{"kind":"word-form-choice","sourceId":"v1:part5:18:12","wordId":"integral-18","prompt":"Scanning the shipment number is an ________ part of tracking these containers.","answer":"integral","options":["integral","integrate","integrating","integration"],"sourceVersion":"7f76b182a0d6"},{"kind":"word-form-choice","sourceId":"v1:part5:18:13","wordId":"minimize-18","prompt":"Keeping customer complaints to a ________ is the job of everyone who works in the store.","answer":"minimum","options":["minimum","minimal","minimize","minimally"],"sourceVersion":"7f76b182a0d6"},{"kind":"word-form-choice","sourceId":"v1:part5:18:14","wordId":"ship-18","prompt":"To keep distribution costs low, we have selected only two ________ firms for the region.","answer":"shipping","options":["ship","shipment","shipping","shipper"],"sourceVersion":"7f76b182a0d6"},{"kind":"word-form-choice","sourceId":"v1:part5:18:15","wordId":"sufficiently-18","prompt":"Based on their credit check, it seems likely that they have ________ funds to cover this order.","answer":"sufficient","options":["suffice","sufficient","sufficiently","sufficed"],"sourceVersion":"7f76b182a0d6"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:accurately-18:0","wordId":"accurately-18","prompt":"To gauge these figures ________, we first need to get some facts from the shipping department.","answer":"accurately","options":["accurately","sufficiently","automatically","promptly"],"sourceVersion":"7f76b182a0d6"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:carrier-18:0","wordId":"carrier-18","prompt":"Lou, our favorite ________, takes extra care of our boxes marked \"fragile.\"","answer":"carrier","options":["carrier","order","liability","customer"],"sourceVersion":"7f76b182a0d6"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:catalog-18:0","wordId":"catalog-18","prompt":"The upcoming fall ________ shows a number of items from Laos that Mr. Lau has never before been able to offer.","answer":"catalog","options":["catalog","supply","carrier","adjustment"],"sourceVersion":"7f76b182a0d6"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:fulfill-18:1","wordId":"fulfill-18","prompt":"Her expectations were so high, we knew they would be hard to ________.","answer":"fulfill","options":["fulfill","disturb","maintain","obtain"],"sourceVersion":"7f76b182a0d6"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:integral-18:0","wordId":"integral-18","prompt":"Good customer relations is an ________ component of any business.","answer":"integral","options":["integral","mandatory","on hand","tedious"],"sourceVersion":"7f76b182a0d6"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:inventory-18:0","wordId":"inventory-18","prompt":"The store closes one day a year so that the staff can take ________ of the stockroom.","answer":"inventory","options":["inventory","quality","catalog","carrier"],"sourceVersion":"7f76b182a0d6"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:minimize-18:1","wordId":"minimize-18","prompt":"To keep the customers happy and to ________ the effect of the carrier strike, we shipped orders directly to them.","answer":"minimize","options":["minimize","impose","charge","scan"],"sourceVersion":"7f76b182a0d6"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:on-hand-18:0","wordId":"on-hand-18","prompt":"We had too much stock ________, so we had a summer sale.","answer":"on hand","options":["on hand","smooth","crucial","tedious"],"sourceVersion":"7f76b182a0d6"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:remember-18:1","wordId":"remember-18","prompt":"will ________ the combination to the safe without writing it down.","answer":"remember","options":["remember","function","estimate","charge"],"sourceVersion":"7f76b182a0d6"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:sufficiently-18:0","wordId":"sufficiently-18","prompt":"The boxcar was ________ damaged that it could not be loaded on the truck.","answer":"sufficiently","options":["sufficiently","strictly","accurately","essentially"],"sourceVersion":"7f76b182a0d6"}]}
